  "payload": {
    "rawResponseText": "When owners want a **collection** or **soft-brand** option for a hotel conversion, the brands most commonly considered globally are **Marriott’s Autograph Collection, Tribute Portfolio, and Luxury Collection; Hilton’s Curio Collection and Tapestry Collection; IHG’s Vignette Collection; Accor’s Handwritten Collection; and Wyndham’s Trademark Collection, Registry Collection, and Dolce**.[3][18][19]\n\nFor **conversion-focused** brands specifically, the ones most often highlighted are **IHG’s Garner, voco, and Vignette Collection; Marriott’s City Express by Marriott and Four Points Flex by Sheraton; Hilton’s Spark by Hilton; and Choice’s conversion-friendly midscale brands such as Clarion Pointe and Quality Inn**.[1][2][4][5][7][10][11]\n\nIf you want, I can also sort these by **luxury, upscale, midscale, or economy**, or by which ones are most active **outside the U.S.**.",
